1
00:00:00,090 --> 00:00:01,630
(Penny:)I'm not talking to you.

2
00:00:01,630 --> 00:00:03,830
(Zack:)Then who are you talking to?

3
00:00:06,630 --> 00:00:09,800
(Zack:)Babe?

4
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:12,670
Penny, Penny, Penny, Penny,
Penny, Penny, Penny,

5
00:00:12,670 --> 00:00:15,470
Penny, Penny, Penny,
Penny, Penny, Penny, Penny,

6
00:00:15,470 --> 00:00:16,840
Penny, Penny, Penny, Penny

7
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:18,080
Penny, Penny...

8
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:21,000
(Raj:)What the hell
is wrong with you?

9
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,180
(Sheldon:)I'm the Flash.

10
00:00:22,180 --> 00:00:23,880
(Sheldon:)I just knocked 30,000 times.

11
00:00:23,880 --> 00:00:26,030
(Penny:)Okay. What do you
want, Sheldon?

12
00:00:26,030 --> 00:00:28,850
(Sheldon:)I understand
why you're upset.

13
00:00:28,850 --> 00:00:30,250
(Zack:)Really?

14
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:31,620
(Sheldon:)Yes.

15
00:00:31,620 --> 00:00:34,930
(Sheldon:)You're afraid that costume
makes you look fat.

16
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:38,260
(Sheldon:)No.

17
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:39,430
Wh-What...

18
00:00:39,430 --> 00:00:41,470
(Penny:)Does it?

19
00:00:41,470 --> 00:00:42,830
(Sheldon:)Don't worry.

20
00:00:42,830 --> 00:00:44,370
(Zack:)Wonder Woman
was an Amazon.

21
00:00:44,370 --> 00:00:49,070
(Sheldon:)And Amazons tend to
be very beefy gals.

22
00:00:51,580 --> 00:00:54,030
(Penny:)Good-bye, Sheldon.

23
00:00:55,880 --> 00:01:02,020
(Sheldon:)But they're not blonde,
so put on your wig.

